{"text": "Slide 1\nHalvorsen Family Farms LLC v. AgriNova Seed Co.\nLitigation status report to the members\nPrepared by Roux Tanaka Litigation Partners — June 2, 2026\nPRIVILEGED AND CONFIDENTIAL — ATTORNEY-CLIENT COMMUNICATION\n\nSlide 2\nWhere the case stands\nFiled November 21, 2025, U.S. District Court, N.D. Iowa — No. 6:25-cv-02088-MAC\nAssigned to Hon. Mercy Abiodun-Clark; Judge Abiodun-Clark denied AgriNova's motion to dismiss on March 30, 2026\nClaims surviving: breach of implied warranty (UCC § 2-315), negligent misrepresentation\nLead counsel: Delphine Roux (droux@rouxtanaka.example, 319-555-0148) and Wesley Tanaka-Brooks\n\nSlide 3\nKey dates\nEvent\tDate\nRule 26(f) report filed\t04/20/2026\nFact discovery closes\t10/30/2026\nExpert reports due\t12/15/2026\nMediation (E. Stoltzfus)\t09/09/2026\nTrial-ready date\t05/03/2027\n\nSlide 4\nDiscovery status\nWe produced 14,200 pages, including planting records for the Black Hawk County and Butler County fields\nAgriNova has produced lot records for seed lot AN-24-77193 only; motion to compel being drafted\nRule 30(b)(6) deposition of AgriNova noticed for July 22, 2026 in Des Moines\nGunnar and Ingrid will each be deposed in August; prep sessions to be scheduled with Wes\n\nSlide 5\nDamages model\nExpert: Cedar Valley Agronomy Consultants, Inc. — preliminary report supports the yield figure; expect a Daubert challenge\nCorn Belt Mutual Insurance Group paid $310,000 on crop policy MPCI-19-0044817 and holds a subrogation interest\nItem\tAmount\nLost yield, 2,340 acres\t$1,872,000\nReplant and inputs\t$214,650\nLost premium contracts\t$388,000\nTotal claimed\t$2,474,650\n\nSlide 6\nSettlement posture\nAgriNova's opening number at the March call: $350k plus seed credits — rejected\nOur recommendation: do not go below $1.4 million before the 30(b)(6) deposition\nMr. Stoltzfus (Ezekiel Stoltzfus, retired magistrate) mediated the 2023 Corn Belt hail cases and knows the carriers\n\nSlide 7\nBudget and next steps\nFees billed to date: $186,412.75; estimate through trial: $520,000 to $610,000\nMatter no. HFF-0031; invoices go to Gunnar Halvorsen, managing member\nDecision needed from the members in Q3: authority range for the September mediation\nQuestions: call Delphine direct at (319) 555-0102", "kind": "PowerPoint presentation", "detail": "7 slides · 324 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Delphine Roux", "Wesley Tanaka-Brooks", "Ezekiel Stoltzfus", "Gunnar Halvorsen", "Ingrid Halvorsen"], "companies": ["Halvorsen Family Farms LLC", "AgriNova Seed Co.", "Cedar Valley Agronomy Consultants, Inc.", "AgriNova", "Corn Belt Mutual Insurance Group"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 2.800000000745058, "modelMs": 21091, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 8, "end": 34, "text": "Halvorsen Family Farms LLC", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Halvorsen Family Farms LLC"}, {"start": 38, "end": 55, "text": "AgriNova Seed Co.", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "AgriNova Seed Co."}, {"start": 108, "end": 139, "text": "Roux Tanaka Litigation Partners", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Roux Tanaka Litigation Partners"}, {"start": 142, "end": 154, "text": "June 2, 2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "June 2, 2026"}, {"start": 252, "end": 269, "text": "November 21, 2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "November 21, 2025"}, {"start": 271, "end": 284, "text": "U.S. District", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "U.S. District"}, {"start": 292, "end": 301, "text": "N.D. Iowa", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "N.D. Iowa"}, {"start": 308, "end": 325, "text": "6:25-cv-02088-MAC", "kind